b","label":"prep.","definitionZh":"每","glossesEn":["per"]},{"id":"to:o:47161f4e1c1b","label":"prep.","definitionZh":"向…表示敬意","glossesEn":["in honour of"],"examples":[{"english":"a monument to the soldiers who died in the war","chinese":"阵亡士兵纪念碑"},{"english":"to Jean","chinese":"献给琼"},{"english":"to our dear son","chinese":"致我们的爱子"}]},{"id":"to:o:e95e991e97b7","label":"prep.","definitionZh":"为…专用","glossesEn":["for exclusive use of"],"examples":[{"english":"a room to myself","chinese":"我自己的房间"}]},{"id":"to:o:863c51babcf0","label":"prep.","definitionZh":"为了给","glossesEn":["with intention of giving sth"],"examples":[{"english":"people rushed to her rescue","chinese":"人们冲上前去救她"}]},{"id":"to:o:575c30fcfe4e","label":"prep.","definitionZh":"伴随","glossesEn":["indicating accompaniment"],"examples":[{"english":"they danced to the music","chinese":"他们随音乐起舞"},{"english":"to the sound of the drums","chinese":"伴着鼓点声"}]},{"id":"to:o:095603599345","label":"prep.","definitionZh":"与…一致","glossesEn":["in accordance with"],"examples":[{"english":"it isn’t to my taste","chinese":"这不对我的口味"},{"english":"is the map to scale?","chinese":"这张地图符合比例吗？"},{"english":"the train is running to time","chinese":"列车准点运行"}]},{"id":"to:o:89c33f36dc44","label":"prep.","definitionZh":"按…的看法","glossesEn":["in the opinion of"],"examples":[{"english":"to my daughter, it's just a minor problem","chinese":"对我女儿来说，这只是个小问题"},{"english":"it looks to me like rain","chinese":"我看像是要下雨了"}]},{"id":"to:o:e80d1e10d067","label":"prep.","definitionZh":"让","glossesEn":["showing reaction"],"examples":[{"english":"to his dismay/surprise","chinese":"令他惊愕/惊讶的是"}]},{"id":"to:o:5dbaf077b4d0","label":"inf. part.","definitionZh":"表示目的、结果或原因","glossesEn":["expressing intention, outcome, cause"],"examples":[{"english":"he did it to impress his friends","chinese":"他那样做是为了打动朋友们"},{"english":"she managed to escape","chinese":"她设法逃脱了"},{"english":"I’m sorry to hear that","chinese":"听到那个消息我很抱歉"}]},{"id":"to:o:17d8b3711368","label":"inf. 